// IP progression-marker reset harness: minimal stand-in types. TEST-ONLY.
//
// The pinned_*.inc files included below are GENERATED by
// tests/ip_marker_reset_extract.py from the exact pinned Core / Playerbots /
// IP sources. They contain VERBATIM enum definitions and function bodies.
// This header only supplies the smallest set of stand-in types those
// verbatim bodies reference (Player bookkeeping containers, Quest fields,
// ObjectMgr quest map, a recording CharacterDatabase).
//
// Nothing here is Worldserver, a database or gameplay. A passing run proves
// that the *extracted pinned bodies*, compiled and executed against these
// stand-ins, delete IP stage markers and queue their DB delete. Behaviour
// that depends on code outside the extracted bodies is NOT covered here.
